flowchart TB
  subgraph core["Core API"]
    TinyDB
    Table
    Document
    Query
    QueryInstance
  end

  subgraph persistence["Persistence layer"]
    Storage
    JSONStorage
    MemoryStorage
    Middleware
    CachingMiddleware
  end

  subgraph support["Supporting components"]
    LRUCache
    operations
    FrozenDict
  end

  TinyDB -->|manages| Table
  Table -->|wraps| Document
  Query -->|builds| QueryInstance
  QueryInstance -->|filters| Document
  TinyDB -->|read / write| Storage
  JSONStorage -->|implements| Storage
  MemoryStorage -->|implements| Storage
  Middleware -->|wraps| Storage
  CachingMiddleware -->|implements| Middleware
  Table -->|query cache| LRUCache
  Table -->|update helpers| operations
  QueryInstance -->|stable query hashes| FrozenDict
